     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋> <A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209002445.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209002445.jpg" width=9966 height=4078> </A>经过</FONT>6<FONT face=仿宋>天的汗水洗礼，戎装下的青春在铿锵步伐、嘹亮军歌中美丽绽放。</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>8</FONT><FONT face=仿宋>月</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>30</FONT><FONT face=仿宋>日下午，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋>绍兴一中高一新生军训会操表演为此次军训活动奏响了青春最强音。全体新生于操场上整装待发，等待最后的检阅。校党委书记、校长王琛及全体领导班子成员，兰溪市国防教育基地全体教官，德育处、体育组和高一年级组全体班主任，以及部分家长代表，一起见证了全体高一新生这场美丽的蜕变与成长。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 0.0000; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋>检阅：朝气蓬勃的一中新人</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋>   全体高一新生以班级为单位组成</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">16<FONT face=仿宋>支连队，豪迈矫健，意气风发，以昂扬的斗志、壮盛的军容接受检阅。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋>王琛校长在检阅中向受训新生表示深切问候。</FONT>“致敬英雄，成才报国”，响亮的呐喊是一中新人的青春誓言。</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209035488.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209035443.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209035421.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209035460.jpg"><BR></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋>会操：军容壮盛的团队风采</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋>   伴随着雄壮豪迈的《解放军进行曲》，军训分列式表演正式开始。整齐划一的步伐，掷地有声的口号，规范有力的动作，展现各个连队饱满的精神面貌和良好的训练效果。这一刻，一中学子们为六天的刻苦训练交上了一份令人满意的答卷。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> <IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209051190.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209051182.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209051160.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209051187.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209051168.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209051151.jpg"><BR><BR></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋>   随后，全体高一新生唱响《当那一天来临》，对祖国许下庄严承诺：作为新时代的中国少年，将</FONT>“接过前辈手中钢枪，捍卫祖国领土；接过前辈手中旗帜，扬我中华大国风范”。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋>   手语操表演《听我说谢谢你》表达了一中学子对每个时代不计报酬、不惧生死的人民英雄的崇高敬意。全体高一新生以军人之最高礼仪，向英雄敬礼：</FONT>“人民英雄，你们辛苦了！”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> <IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209062014.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209062012.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209062089.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209062030.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209062011.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209062093.jpg"><BR><BR></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋>寄语：青春盛会强使命担当</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋>   孙洪亮副书记发表军训总结讲话。他首先提议全体同学用掌声向所有为军训付出艰辛劳动的工作人员表达敬意和感恩，他表扬同学们军训所取得的成长收获，强调一中学子要把立志报国作为成才的最根本底色，希望全体一中新人保持良好的军人作风，以更加饱满的热情和顽强的意志迎接崭新的高中学习挑战，为国家强盛、民族复兴勇担使命。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p> <IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209065269.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209065267.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202009/2020090209065245.jpg"><BR><BR></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=仿宋>颁奖：热血汗水铸荣耀勋章</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
